  "title": {
   "en": "Kenzen na Koitte nandakke?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "健全な恋ってなんだっけ？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sawa is a game enthusiast and a ordinary office worker in her twenties.\nHowever, she has a younger childhood friend, Souta, with who she has an “unusual relationship”. Souta, who is more than a best friend but less than a lover, often comes over to her house. One day, on her way home from a high school reunion, she was approached by Aihara, who she had a crush on at the time. \"Can I go over to your house?\" Sawa brings him up to her house, and they have a physical affair. Sawa is at the mercy of multiple love affairs that are not healthy.\n\nA modern girl and three handsome boys. Their hearts and bodies are shaken by the four-cornered relationship."
  },
